<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<TAUNTS>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>0</uiIndex>
    <szText>어이, 누가 날 만졌어?</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>1</uiIndex>
    <szText>이봐, 네 엄마가 네 장난감은 안 사줬냐?</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <brave>1</brave>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>2</uiIndex>
    <szText>젠장, 이건 정말 순식간이었네!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <defensive>1</defensive>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>3</uiIndex>
    <szText>물건을 훔치는 건 결국 죽음으로 이어질 뿐이야!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>4</uiIndex>
    <szText>어! 저거 내 거야!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>5</uiIndex>
    <szText>이 짠돌이야, 네 물건은 네가 직접 사!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <cunning>1</cunning>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>6</uiIndex>
    <szText>뭐... 그냥 놔둬, 어차피 쓸모없는 물건이니까!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <brave>1</brave>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>7</uiIndex>
    <szText>이 망할 자식아, 네 손을 잘라버리겠어!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <aggressive>1</aggressive>
  </TAUNT>
  <TAUNT>
    <uiIndex>8</uiIndex>
    <szText>이 지역에서 도둑을 어떻게 다루는지 보여주지!</szText>
    <got_robbed>1</got_robbed>
    <aggressive>1</aggressive>
  </TAUNT>
</TAUNTS>